An [[Afflicted Monk]] is an [[undead]] [[monk]] corrupted by the malevolent spirit of [[Shiro Tagachi]]. They are always encountered in a group with other [[Afflicted]]. They are relatively poor healers and unlike [[Afflicted Ritualist]]s, they do not have any [[resurrection]] skill, but their [[Ray of Judgment]] can deal a lot of AoE damage.

